---
import Section from '../Section.astro';
import Button from '../Button.astro';
---

<Section variant="white" id="final-cta">
  <div class="text-center">
    <h2 class="text-h2 mb-md max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      Your systems should make the business easier to run.
    </h2>
    <p class="text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-lg">
      If manual work, disconnected systems, poor visibility, or operational
      complexity are limiting the business, Guava can help determine what should
      change and build the systems required to change it.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-md">
      <Button variant="primary" href="/book-a-demo">Book a Demo</Button>
      <Button variant="outline" href="/contact">Contact Guava</Button>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>